#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/guideline-domain.glossary.json:37
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/guideline-domain/health-system-strengthening
msgid "A guideline whose recommendations address how the health system itself is organised and resourced — service delivery, health workforce, health information systems, access to medical products, financing, and leadership and governance — rather than a particular condition or population intervention."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/guideline-domain.glossary.json:11
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/guideline-domain/clinical
msgid "A guideline whose recommendations address the care of individual patients by health workers: assessment, diagnosis, treatment and management of a condition in a person."
msgstr ""

#: folio-assistant-core/glossary/guideline-domain.glossary.json:24
#. Glossary term definition: https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-core/v0/ns/glossary/guideline-domain/public-health
msgid "A guideline whose recommendations address the health of populations rather than of an individual patient: prevention, health promotion, immunization and screening programmes, surveillance, and policy or environmental measures."
msgstr ""

